Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Fishing in Troubled Waters
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 19
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.05,0:00:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The little girl is yours; leave Blue Scarf to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.93,0:00:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.85,0:00:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I advise you not to resist, or you might get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.21,0:00:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.45,0:00:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for? Go get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.01,0:01:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! That could hurt Xiao Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.61,0:01:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys any good or not? Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.66,0:01:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for my signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.17,0:01:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then run toward the back window.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.29,0:01:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.81,0:01:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll hold them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.93,0:01:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.01,0:02:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about running.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.30,0:02:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you my true power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.61,0:02:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha Erlang, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:03:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Scarf has already been hit by the miasma; they won’t get far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.21,0:03:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I’m the only one with the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.78,0:03:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean I’ve been hit by the miasma too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.77,0:03:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha Erlang, you didn’t even warn me beforehand!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.17,0:03:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, this is an antidote for the miasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.61,0:03:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just focus on your recovery while I go capture them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.41,0:03:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, hurry up and set out to catch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as they are still in this desert,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.17,0:03:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,they won’t be able to escape my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.97,0:03:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.61,0:03:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.21,0:04:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the miasma is starting to take effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.61,0:04:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Assemble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.81,0:04:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Scarf is nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.61,0:04:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your communicators and get out to search.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.21,0:04:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Signal me when you spot Blue Scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.97,0:04:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.25,0:04:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We probably shouldn’t go in ourselves, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.97,0:04:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry; given her current abilities…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.97,0:04:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,…she poses no threat to you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.29,0:05:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.65,0:05:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, find a way to stay inside the combat vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.89,0:05:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.37,0:05:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we rescue Xiao Mei now…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.81,0:05:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,…we won’t be able to escape Cha Erlang’s pursuit across this desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.64,0:05:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.49,0:05:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan—we just need to take three steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.01,0:05:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you two whispering about? Hurry up and catch up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.38,0:05:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.89,0:05:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.49,0:05:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you run? It was a perfect opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.98,0:05:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you took care of me when I had a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.05,0:05:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, that was just part of the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But you need help right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.41,0:06:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t need anyone’s help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over here, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.37,0:06:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,First, when they’ve battered each other in the chaos…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.05,0:06:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,…I’ll take Xiao Mei away while they’re distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.65,0:06:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You two, go search up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.81,0:06:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If it were me…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.37,0:07:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you standing there for? Go grab them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.61,0:07:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, she doesn’t have a weapon anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.89,0:07:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So Boss was right; she really can’t see anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.65,0:07:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can settle the score for what happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, they’re coming over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.57,0:07:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s nowhere left for you to run this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.89,0:07:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you betray us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.45,0:07:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry, but I’m one of the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.09,0:08:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never stoop to your level.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.93,0:08:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, Weslie has turned traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.09,0:08:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And the second step requires you to sabotage it from the inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.37,0:08:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,to make sure this vehicle can’t move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.97,0:08:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie actually betrayed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.21,0:08:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll make him see the consequences of betraying me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.01,0:08:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on? It’s stopped moving again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,After completing the first two steps, we’ll meet up at that location.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.81,0:08:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it’s time to find the meeting point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.41,0:09:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand Xiao Mei over to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.01,0:09:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.17,0:09:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t fight! My mom said we should communicate properly when there’s a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.61,0:09:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.81,0:09:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all times for this to happen…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.05,0:09:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A sandstorm is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.56,0:09:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the vehicle breaking down again? It must be Weslie’s accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.21,0:09:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, catch that Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.41,0:10:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster! A monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.05,0:10:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My gear! You guys, hurry and help me catch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is going smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sure we’ll get Xiao Mei settled soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.21,0:10:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,then find the rift,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and discover a way for me to return to normal so we can go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.76,0:10:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you taking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,After it! Get my gear back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.76,0:10:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this monster be here to snatch the fragment inside my gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.05,0:10:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who else is after it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The drone shows the fragment is nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.17,0:10:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.65,0:10:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He has the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.69,0:10:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep chasing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.29,0:11:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over the fragment you picked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.65,0:11:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You forced my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.81,0:11:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.21,0:11:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Why do you want the fragment?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.05,0:11:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren’t worthy of knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.01,0:11:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m done being a villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t let me see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.09,0:12:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s head to the next location.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
